=2 Walkthrough
* Zone after finishing the previous quest.
* Speak to {n:Honoi-Gomoi} to begin the quest.
** He is upstairs in his house, which is accessed through a back stairway.
* Speak to {n:Kohlo-Lakolo}, {z:Port Windurst} (G-5).
* Head to {z:Windurst Walls} (G-3) and check the door at the **House of the Hero**.
* Head to {z:Toraimarai Canal} and open a Coffer there to obtain the {k:Joker card}.
** Picking the coffer as a {p:Thief} will work.
** Various mobs in this zone drops the {i:Toraimarai Coffer Key|Toraimarai Coffer Key|1057}, or you can buy one from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} for 5,000 gil.
* If you spoke to Joker during the previous cut-scene, return to to the **House of the Hero** for your reward.
* If you spoke to Apururu, return to the **Manustery** in **Windurst Woods** (use Home Point #3).
* Return to {n:Honoi-Gomoi} to complete the quest.

